      <section class="i2-journey" id="i2-platform">
        <div class="i2-wrap"><div class="i2-heading"><p class="i2-label">One record, start to finish</p><h2>From a stranger on your website to a client you keep.</h2><p>No exporting, no retyping, no second subscription. The record created when someone fills in your form is the same record you are still working from three years later.</p></div><div class="i2-journey-track"><article class="i2-journey-step"><div class="i2-journey-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="globe-2" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-globe-2"><path d="M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54"></path><path d="M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17"></path><path d="M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></div><div><h3>They find you</h3><p>Your site is written, live and public from day one, so it earns the click your competitor is currently taking.</p></div></article><article class="i2-journey-step"><div class="i2-journey-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="inbox" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-inbox"><polyline points="22 12 16 12 14 15 10 15 8 12 2 12"></polyline><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"></path></svg></div><div><h3>The enquiry lands</h3><p>The website form creates a prospect record in your client list the moment it is submitted.</p></div></article><article class="i2-journey-step"><div class="i2-journey-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="phone-call" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-phone-call"><path d="M13 2a9 9 0 0 1 9 9"></path><path d="M13 6a5 5 0 0 1 5 5"></path><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg></div><div><h3>You follow up</h3><p>Follow-ups carry a name, a reason and a date, so the next call is decided before you sit down to make it.</p></div></article><article class="i2-journey-step"><div class="i2-journey-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="users" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-users"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div><div><h3>They become a client</h3><p>Notes, account type, meetings, campaigns and &mdash; on Platinum &mdash; the client portal and their invoices hang off one record.</p></div></article><article class="i2-journey-step"><div class="i2-journey-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="heart-handshake" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-heart-handshake"><path d="M19.414 14.414C21 12.828 22 11.5 22 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-9.591-3.676.6.6 0 0 1-.818.001A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 9.5c0 2.3 1.5 4 3 5.5l5.535 5.362a2 2 0 0 0 2.879.052 2.12 2.12 0 0 0-.004-3 2.124 2.124 0 1 0 3-3 2.124 2.124 0 0 0 3.004 0 2 2 0 0 0 0-2.828l-1.881-1.882a2.41 2.41 0 0 0-3.409 0l-1.71 1.71a2 2 0 0 1-2.828 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.828l2.823-2.762"></path></svg></div><div><h3>They stay</h3><p>Newsletters, campaigns and review reminders keep you in front of them between meetings, which is where most advisers quietly lose people.</p></div></article></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="i2-section"><div class="i2-wrap i2-story"><div class="i2-story-copy"><p class="i2-label">Before you change a thing</p><h2>Nothing starts from a blank page.</h2><p>Your site arrives with the writing already done for your market. From there it is four moves, and not one of them waits on us.</p></div><div class="i2-story-points"><article class="i2-story-point"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="file-text" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-file-text"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path></svg><div><h3>The pages are already written</h3><p>Real starter content for your market, in the language you already use. <em>Your move: rewrite any of it in the page builder.</em></p></div></article><article class="i2-story-point"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="book-open" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-book-open"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg><div><h3>The article library is real</h3><p>A Resources section of genuine articles, not headings with placeholder text underneath. <em>Your move: add your own.</em></p></div></article><article class="i2-story-point"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="calendar-check" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-calendar-check"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path><path d="m9 16 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><div><h3>The meeting form fits your market</h3><p>A &ldquo;Request a Meeting&rdquo; form worded for the work you do, wired into your client records. <em>Your move: reword it, or bring your clients across.</em></p></div></article><article class="i2-story-point"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="calculator" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-calculator"><rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="14" y2="18"></line><path d="M16 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 10h.01"></path><path d="M8 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 14h.01"></path><path d="M8 14h.01"></path><path d="M12 18h.01"></path><path d="M8 18h.01"></path></svg><div><h3>The Canadian calculators are in place</h3><p>Mortgage payment, affordability, land transfer tax by province, retirement and savings. <em>Your move: point your own domain at it and go.</em></p></div></article></div></div></section>

      <section class="i2-section i2-white" id="i2-pricing"><div class="i2-wrap"><div class="i2-heading"><p class="i2-label">Packages compared clearly</p><h2>Pay for the level of relationship management you need.</h2><p>Every package includes the foundation. Gold adds richer communication tools; Platinum adds the daily assistant, portal and invoicing.</p></div>
        
        @if (Model.Any())
        {
          @* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
             LIVE DATA, not copy. Prices, the annual figure and the setup fee all render
             from the BillingRule rows, and the waiver renders from IsSetupFeeWaivedOn --
             the SAME call that decides what PayPal charges. Hardcoding any of it here is
             how the page and the charge drift apart. The prototype carries this warning
             too; see its RAZOR PORT NOTE.
             --------------------------------------------------------------------------- *@
          var allFeatures = Model
            .SelectMany(p => p.Features)
            .GroupBy(f => f.FeatureCode)
            .Select(g => g.First())
            .OrderBy(f => f.SortOrder)
            .ToList();
          <div class="i2-plan-table-wrap">
            <table id="i2-plan-table" class="i2-plan-table @(allFeatures.Count > 6 ? "i2-collapsed" : "")" aria-label="IPRO package comparison">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Included</th>
                  @foreach (var package in Model)
                  {
                    var featured = package.PackageName == "IPro Platinum";
                    <th class="@(featured ? "i2-featured" : "")">
                      <span class="i2-plan-name">@package.PackageName.Replace("IPro ", "")</span>
                      @if (package.MonthlyPrice > 0)
                      {
                        <span class="i2-plan-price">$@package.MonthlyPrice.ToString("N0") <small>/ month</small></span>
                      }
                      @if (package.AnnualPrice > 0)
                      {
                        <span class="i2-plan-annual">or $@package.AnnualPrice.ToString("N0")/yr (two months free)</span>
                      }
                      @if (package.SetupFee > 0)
                      {
                        if (package.IsSetupFeeWaivedOn(DateTime.UtcNow))
                        {
                          <span class="i2-plan-annual"><s>$@package.SetupFee.ToString("N0")</s> setup fee waived@(package.SetupFeeWaivedUntil.HasValue ? $" until {package.SetupFeeWaivedUntil.Value:MMMM d}" : "")</span>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                          <span class="i2-plan-annual">+ $@package.SetupFee.ToString("N0") one-time setup</span>
                        }
                      }
                    </th>
                  }
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                @foreach (var feature in allFeatures)
                {
                  <tr>
                    <td>@feature.FeatureName</td>
                    @foreach (var package in Model)
                    {
                      var featured = package.PackageName == "IPro Platinum";
                      var match = package.Features.FirstOrDefault(f => f.FeatureCode == feature.FeatureCode);
                      <td class="@(featured ? "i2-featured" : "")">
                        @if (match != null && match.IsIncluded)
                        {
                          if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(match.LimitLabel))
                          {
                            <span class="i2-plan-limit">@match.LimitLabel</span>
                          }
                          else
                          {
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" role="img" aria-label="Included" class="lucide lucide-check"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
                          }
                        }
                        else
                        {
                          <span class="i2-plan-no" aria-label="Not included">&mdash;</span>
                        }
                      </td>
                    }
                  </tr>
                }
                <tr>
                  <td></td>
                  @foreach (var package in Model)
                  {
                    var featured = package.PackageName == "IPro Platinum";
                    <td class="@(featured ? "i2-featured" : "")">
                      @* ?package= is what prefills the plan on the registration form and the preview. *@
                      <a class="i2-action" href="/Account/Register?package=@Uri.EscapeDataString(package.PackageName)">Get started</a>
                      <a class="i2-plan-preview" href="/Preview?package=@Uri.EscapeDataString(package.PackageName)">See a @package.PackageName.Replace("IPro ", "") site first</a>
                    </td>
                  }
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          @if (allFeatures.Count > 6)
          {
            <button type="button" id="i2-pricing-toggle" class="i2-action-outline i2-pricing-toggle"
                    aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="i2-plan-table"
                    data-more="Show the full comparison (@(allFeatures.Count - 6) more rows)">Show the full comparison (@(allFeatures.Count - 6) more rows)</button>
          }
        }
        else
        {
          <p class="i2-plan-empty">Pricing is being updated &mdash; <a href="/Account/Register">start your registration</a> and we will follow up with plan details.</p>
        }<p class="i2-plan-note">Canadian dollars before applicable tax.</p><div class="i2-pricing-footer"><span>Brokerage or multi-agent business? Team pricing is a conversation, based on users, sites and support needs.</span><a class="i2-action-outline" href="#i2-contact">Discuss team pricing</a></div></div></section>

      <section class="i2-section i2-trust" id="i2-trust"><div class="i2-wrap i2-trust-grid"><div><div class="i2-heading"><p class="i2-label">Why businesses move to IPRO</p><h2>One provider. One login. One number to call when something breaks.</h2><p>IPRO has built websites and business tools for Canadian professional-service firms since 2014. That is the whole pitch: instead of a web designer, a spreadsheet and a mail tool that do not speak to each other, there is one system and one place to ask.</p></div><div class="i2-founder"><div class="i2-founder-line"><div class="i2-founder-avatar"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="building-2" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-building-2"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><path d="M10 8h4"></path><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"></path></svg></div><div><h3>Established Canadian experience</h3><small>Websites and business tools since 2014</small></div></div><p>Your website, hosting, client tools and support stay with one team. There is one place to ask questions, one system to learn and no chain of unrelated vendors to coordinate.</p></div></div><div class="i2-trust-items"><article class="i2-trust-item"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="database" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-database"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5"></path><path d="M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12"></path></svg><h3>Your data leaves as easily as it arrives</h3><p>Import the records you have, work from them here, and export them whenever you want &mdash; no hostage-taking on the way out.</p></article><article class="i2-trust-item"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="shield-check" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-shield-check"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3>Hosting, domain and SSL are ours to worry about</h3><p>The certificate, the renewal and the connection to your domain are part of the subscription.</p></article><article class="i2-trust-item"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="monitor-check" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-monitor-check"><path d="m9 10 2 2 4-4"></path><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M12 17v4"></path><path d="M8 21h8"></path></svg><h3>Nothing starts from a blank page</h3><p>Your site launches with written pages, a Resources library, a &ldquo;Request a Meeting&rdquo; form and Canadian calculators.</p></article><article class="i2-trust-item"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="map-pin" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-map-pin"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h3>Nothing to adjust for the border</h3><p>No line to correct before it reaches a client.</p></article></div></div></section>

      <section class="i2-section i2-contact" id="i2-contact"><div class="i2-wrap i2-contact-grid"><div class="i2-contact-copy"><p class="i2-label">Get in touch</p><h2>Look at it first. Decide after.</h2><p>The preview needs nothing from you but a name, a business name and a market, and it runs on its own. For the questions that come after &mdash; packages, domains, moving your records over, or how a team would work &mdash; email us and a person answers.</p><div class="i2-contact-list"><div class="i2-contact-item"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="monitor-dot" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-monitor-dot"><path d="M12 17v4"></path><path d="M22 12.307V15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8.693"></path><path d="M8 21h8"></path><circle cx="19" cy="6" r="3"></circle></svg><div><b>Free website preview</b><span>See your market, business name and starting content.</span></div></div><div class="i2-contact-item"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="messages-square" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-messages-square"><path d="M16 10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 14.286V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path><path d="M20 9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10.286a.71.71 0 0 1-1.212.502l-2.202-2.202A2 2 0 0 0 17.172 19H10a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1"></path></svg><div><b>Sales and setup questions</b><span>Packages, domains, migration and multi-agent options.</span></div></div><div class="i2-contact-item"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="life-buoy" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-life-buoy"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m4.93 4.93 4.24 4.24"></path><path d="m14.83 9.17 4.24-4.24"></path><path d="m14.83 14.83 4.24 4.24"></path><path d="m9.17 14.83-4.24 4.24"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle></svg><div><b>Existing customer support</b><span>Training, billing and technical help.</span></div></div></div></div><div class="i2-form">
            <div class="i2-field"><b>Start with the preview</b><span>It needs a name, a business name and a market, and it runs on its own &mdash; nothing to book and nobody to wait for.</span></div>
            <a class="i2-action" href="/Preview">Build my free preview <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
            <div class="i2-field"><b>Questions first?</b><span>Packages, domains, moving your records across, or how a team would work &mdash; email <a href="mailto:support@@iproadvisers.com">support@@iproadvisers.com</a>.</span></div>
            <a class="i2-plan-preview" href="/Account/Register">Or create an account now</a>
          </div></div></section>
    </main>

