tact">Contact</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a></div></div></div><div class="i2-footer-bottom"><span>&copy; 2026 IPRO Advisers. Canadian dollars before applicable tax.</span><span>Built and supported in Canada.</span></div></div></footer>
